---
import { ArrowDownRight, ArrowUpRight } from 'lucide-astro';
---
<section class="hero section-wrap" id="now">
  <div class="hero-intro">
    <p class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot"></span>正在持续更新 <span class="mono">/ 2024—2025</span></p>
    <h1>把好奇心，<br /><em>做成可以访问的东西。</em></h1>
    <p class="hero-lede">这里是 Bai 的个人空间。记录代码之外的观察，整理反复使用的工具，也展示一些还在生长中的实验。</p>
    <div class="hero-links">
      <a class="button button-dark" href="#writing">浏览文章 <ArrowDownRight /></a>
      <a class="text-link" href="mailto:hello@bai.page">联系我 <ArrowUpRight /></a>
    </div>
    <dl class="stats">
      <div><dt>文章</dt><dd>28</dd></div>
      <div><dt>项目</dt><dd>12</dd></div>
      <div><dt>工具</dt><dd>19</dd></div>
      <div><dt>最后更新</dt><dd>03.18</dd></div>
    </dl>
  </div>
  <div class="now-panel">
    <div class="now-head"><span class="section-label">NOW PLAYING</span><span class="pulse-line"></span></div>
    <div class="now-image-wrap">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1518770660439-4636190af475?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85" alt="桌面上的电子元件与开发板" />
      <span class="image-tag">FIELD NOTE 028</span>
    </div>
    <div class="now-content">
      <div><span class="kicker">最近在做</span><h2>给自己的知识<br />重新装一个首页</h2></div>
      <span class="arrow-circle"><ArrowUpRight /></span>
    </div>
    <p class="now-note">一个更轻、更快的个人知识库。先解决访问，再慢慢填满。</p>
    <div class="progress"><span style="width: 68%"></span></div>
    <div class="progress-meta"><span>构建中</span><span>68%</span></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="ticker-band" aria-label="站点主题">
  <div class="ticker-track"><span>BUILD IN PUBLIC</span><b>✳</b><span>THINK SLOWLY</span><b>✳</b><span>MAKE USEFUL THINGS</span><b>✳</b><span>BUILD IN PUBLIC</span><b>✳</b><span>THINK SLOWLY</span><b>✳</b><span>MAKE USEFUL THINGS</span></div>
</section>
